tests/data/synthetic_v7.tdts, tests/data/synthetic_v5.xdts

  Synthetic sample sheets from the vdts-editor project. Their contents are
  invented, not taken from any production timesheet, and so is their shape:
  synthetic_v7.tdts spells one key `showHeaderDummy` where a sheet saved by
  the application has `showHeadDummy`. They are fixtures for reading, and
  synthetic_v5.xdts is this crate's XDTS key reference for want of a real
  one; tests/data/saved_v10.tdts is the TDTS reference.

